# Streamlit UI Conventions

- Match existing visual language: cream/gold Cinzel+Inter theme tokens already in `app.py` CSS.
- Prefer expanders/sections for dense chart tables; keep primary CTA (generate chart / download PDF) obvious.
- Store heavy results in `st.session_state` (`chart_result`, `birth_details`, reading keys) consistently.
- New pages or multi-file Streamlit apps are fine as **additions**; do not reshape the existing single-file flow unless asked.
- Spinner copy and section titles may stay in the current astrological tone.
- Never log or display API keys; use `st.secrets` / env only.
